MEMORY.md:8:- Quality: Day112 S1 A delivered 1.0763 (global 0.2458, S1 group bonus +0.9893), up +0.125 from day105. S2 A/B delivered 0.430/0.516; S3 A/B 0.378/0.454. Competitor posts d111-112 showed small rival boosts (~0.0217 and 0.0266); one S1 post complained quality felt generic.
MEMORY.md:31:- Ads: If cash >=$1.05M, S1 paid CPL <=$6.0 avg (and marginal/weekend not awful), paid conversion >=97%, active S1 age>=2d issues <100, and no negative social spike, consider S1 content ads $11k/day. If CPL >$7.5, conversion <94%, cash <1.0M, or support/social worsens, hold or cut back to $9k.
